026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 10; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nHollis Mbeki (hollis-mbeki, Central team lead) wrote in a direct message with assistant on 2026-10-21 09:00: I need to escalate a Tansley Parcel problem today. Who should I call?\n```","id":10,"source":"hollis-mbeki, a direct message with assistant, 2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 1; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nHollis Mbeki (hollis-mbeki, Central team lead) wrote in a direct message with assistant on 2026-10-14 09:00: For future reference, no action needed: my go-to person at Tansley Parcel for escalations on the Marlowe rollout is Idris Brevik from now on. Please remember that for me.\n```","id":1,"source":"hollis-mbeki, a direct message with assistant, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 6; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in a direct message with hollis-mbeki on 2026-10-16 17:00: I replied to Hollis in our direct message: I've got Soren Tolland down as their escalation contact at Tansleigh Packaging for the Bittern rollout. This conversation is saved in the workspace brain, and only Hollis can see it there, so I can look it up when they ask. I didn't save it a second time, and I'll keep it out of other members' conversations and out of channels.\n```","id":6,"source":"assistant, a direct message with hollis-mbeki, 2026-10-16T17:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"hollis-mbeki"}
